  unitName: Bolt Axe Mahalu
  unitId: 40614
  unitNumber: 1048
  description: The supposed goddess who granted the Sacred Blade to a human who would
    slay powerful demons in her name. Tales of Mahalu were erased by the gods to
    punish her for endowing humans with powers they did not deserve. Though most
    of the gods had no knowledge of the Nine Sacred Treasures that existed in Grand
    Gaia, Mahalu accidentally found two of them and gave them new names. She took
    one of the treasures for her own, and gave the other to a human who would repel
    the demons menacing Grand Gaia.
  summonDesc: Allow me to fight with you.<br>I know I can grow stronger.<br>So please,
    let's go together...
  fusionDesc: You're giving me power?<br>How amusing.<br>Oh no, don't mind me.<br>Continue.
